{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:43b0258bed8f386b","name":"Holoshroud","source":{"id":"source:reference-43b0258bed8f386b","title":"Holoshroud","revision":19461,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T22:01:14Z","sha256":"7288e5de2c64180a53dd64873cfc6d6c57cc25060d8c7930e68b74487e717fe8","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19461","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Holoshroud&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-43b0258bed8f386b","blocks":[{"tag":"h4","children":["General Equipment"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Unleashed Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Unleashed_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 25,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Weight:"]}," 0.5 Kilograms\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Holoshroud is an advanced form of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Holoprojector"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Holoprojector"}," that places a stored holographic image of a creature over the form of the creature wearing the Holoshroud. This creates a nearly perfect visual illusion that moves, acts, and reacts with the wearer. A typical model is the Corellidyne CQ-3.9x Holographic Image Disguiser, though it's far from the only Holoshroud on the market. The CQ-3.9x is able to store a single holographic image to disguise the wearer, though it can be changed if the user has access to other holographic images and makes a DC 15 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Using a Holoshroud gives you a +10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," checks made to produce a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deceptive Appearance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deceptive_Appearance"}," that matches the holographic image within the Holoshroud. Creating or removing this ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deceptive Appearance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deceptive_Appearance"}," is a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," (to turn the Holoshroud on or off), which is not considered a rushed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," and does not take a -10 penalty for lacking the proper time.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Armor Upgrade"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scum and Villainy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scum_and_Villainy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Cost:"]}," 5,000\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Upgrade Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Upgrade_Point"}," Cost:"]}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Availability:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Restricted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Restricted"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["A Holoshroud places small holographic projectors at key points around the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},". These projectors are linked together and designed to place a holographic image over the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," (and its wearer). The image moves as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," moves, making the illusion of a different appearance difficult to penetrate. The Holoshroud can store only a single image, which must be of the same basic size and shape as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," (generally humanoid). The image can be changed with an hour of work and a DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use Computer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_Computer","referenceId":"reference:ff8449006aafd27d"}," check.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Holoshroud provides a +10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks to conceal items (underneath the image) as well as any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," checks made to create a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deceptive Appearance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deceptive_Appearance"}," matching the image. However, the Holoshroud doesn't withstand scrutiny, so any observer who uses a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"}," to search the wearer gains a +10 circumstance bonus on the opposed ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check. Furthermore, the Holoshroud doesn't have any tactile, auditory, or olfactory component, so observers with ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scent"}," or using a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Sensor Pack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sensor_Pack","referenceId":"reference:0d0f0cdf6870cb1b"}," gain a +10 circumstance bonus on their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," checks.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Holoshroud draws power from a standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Energy Cell"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Energy_Cell","referenceId":"reference:a3dedb9c17e4ee9d"},", which gives enough power for twenty rounds of use drawn in any increment. Such armors are often upgraded with the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Extra Power Source"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Extra_Power_Source","referenceId":"reference:e2b64ca7ff6bb072"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Internal Generator"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Internal_Generator","referenceId":"reference:24bf81f33f973d09"}," modifications to extend this operating time. You can turn a Holoshroud on or off as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},".\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
